{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39885","headline":"门外闲田数亩长有泉源因筑直堤分爲两沼 · 徐夤","name":"门外闲田数亩长有泉源因筑直堤分爲两沼","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"左右澄漪小槛前，直堤高筑古平川。\n十分春水双檐影，一片秋空两月悬。\n前岸好山摇细浪，夹门嘉树合晴烟。\n坐来暗起江湖思，速问溪翁买钓船。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐夤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39885.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39885","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}